{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2022-01-27 16:45:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT NAMES TED DECKER CEO, EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2022', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT®, THE WORLD\'S LARGEST HOME IMPROVEMENT RETAILER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EDWARD "TED" DECKER HAS BEEN NAMED CEO AND PRESIDENT, AND HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, ALL EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2022. CRAIG MENEAR, CURRENTLY CHAIRMAN AND CEO, WILL CONTINUE TO SERVE AS CHAIR OF THE BOARD.'}